{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00075",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.04,
      "end_seconds": 4.82,
      "duration_seconds": 3.78,
      "text": "Hi, doctor. Long queue outside, but here I am."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.23,
      "end_seconds": 9.49,
      "duration_seconds": 3.26,
      "text": "No trouble at all, come in. What's been bothering you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 11.08,
      "end_seconds": 13.67,
      "duration_seconds": 2.59,
      "text": "Doctor, thank you for seeing us."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 14.6,
      "end_seconds": 17.94,
      "duration_seconds": 3.34,
      "text": "Of course, please stay. It's helpful to have you here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 18.88,
      "end_seconds": 21.04,
      "duration_seconds": 2.16,
      "text": "We came because of shaky spells."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 21.66,
      "end_seconds": 28.77,
      "duration_seconds": 7.11,
      "text": "Can you describe it a bit more for me? How strong it is, what the pattern is, what helps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 30.06,
      "end_seconds": 53.15,
      "duration_seconds": 23.09,
      "text": "I, I'd say all the time. Severe, I'd say. Missing meals and exercise definitely sets it off. I've had a pounding heart with it too, for ten days. About pounding heart with it, I'd give it a eight, out of ten. It's once or twice a day. I was sweating at one point, but that's gone now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 53.65,
      "end_seconds": 67.44,
      "duration_seconds": 13.79,
      "text": "Just so you know how the rest of the visit will go: I'll finish my notes, we'll agree on the plan, and the front desk will help with anything that needs booking. You shouldn't need to chase anything yourself."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 68.56,
      "end_seconds": 71.59,
      "duration_seconds": 3.03,
      "text": "Good, I was wondering how this would go."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 71.92,
      "end_seconds": 75.67,
      "duration_seconds": 3.75,
      "text": "Okay, any confusion, vomiting or weight loss at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 77.16,
      "end_seconds": 78.91,
      "duration_seconds": 1.75,
      "text": "Nothing like that, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 80.33,
      "end_seconds": 82.02,
      "duration_seconds": 1.69,
      "text": "And seizure, any of that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 86.44,
      "end_seconds": 88.66,
      "duration_seconds": 2.22,
      "text": "No, you know, no seizure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 89.77,
      "end_seconds": 94.35,
      "duration_seconds": 4.58,
      "text": "Is there anyone at home who can help you out if you need it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 95.32,
      "end_seconds": 105.86,
      "duration_seconds": 10.54,
      "text": "Yes, there's family around most evenings, and they've been very good about checking in, although they do worry more than they need to."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 106.91,
      "end_seconds": 107.64,
      "duration_seconds": 0.73,
      "text": "Any smoking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 108.2,
      "end_seconds": 111.12,
      "duration_seconds": 2.92,
      "text": "No, I don't smoke and never have."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 112.59,
      "end_seconds": 114.1,
      "duration_seconds": 1.51,
      "text": "And alcohol, how much?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 114.53,
      "end_seconds": 116.42,
      "duration_seconds": 1.89,
      "text": "I don't drink at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 117.98,
      "end_seconds": 121.87,
      "duration_seconds": 3.89,
      "text": "Have you been able to keep up with your usual activities?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 122.58,
      "end_seconds": 134.41,
      "duration_seconds": 11.83,
      "text": "For the most part, you know, yes. I just carry on and try not to dwell on things too much, though I won't pretend it hasn't crossed my mind a few times."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 134.96,
      "end_seconds": 138.89,
      "duration_seconds": 3.93,
      "text": "Do you have any medical conditions, anything you've been treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 139.49,
      "end_seconds": 142.61,
      "duration_seconds": 3.12,
      "text": "High blood pressure, for about a year."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 143.74,
      "end_seconds": 152.63,
      "duration_seconds": 8.89,
      "text": "Alright. Right, so that's your known high blood pressure. We'll keep that in mind today. Let me know if I'm going too fast."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 154.08,
      "end_seconds": 155.46,
      "duration_seconds": 1.38,
      "text": "No, you're fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 158.15,
      "end_seconds": 159.31,
      "duration_seconds": 1.16,
      "text": "Any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 160.07,
      "end_seconds": 161.27,
      "duration_seconds": 1.2,
      "text": "No operations, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 162.8,
      "end_seconds": 166.13,
      "duration_seconds": 3.33,
      "text": "Sorry about the noise outside, the building work never stops."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 167.43,
      "end_seconds": 169.69,
      "duration_seconds": 2.26,
      "text": "I hadn't even noticed, honestly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 170.81,
      "end_seconds": 172.69,
      "duration_seconds": 1.88,
      "text": "What medicines do you take regularly?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 173.14,
      "end_seconds": 176.94,
      "duration_seconds": 3.8,
      "text": "It's amlodipine, 5 milligrams, once a day, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 177.27,
      "end_seconds": 180.94,
      "duration_seconds": 3.67,
      "text": "Right, do you have everything you need to get home alright?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 182.48,
      "end_seconds": 193.82,
      "duration_seconds": 11.34,
      "text": "Yes, I've got my transport sorted. It's a bit of a trek, but I'm used to the journey by now, and I brought something to read for the wait."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 194.27,
      "end_seconds": 196.17,
      "duration_seconds": 1.9,
      "text": "Any allergies I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 199.69,
      "end_seconds": 203.11,
      "duration_seconds": 3.42,
      "text": "Pollen. I come out in... well, a runny nose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 203.68,
      "end_seconds": 205.6,
      "duration_seconds": 1.92,
      "text": "I'll take a few measurements first."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 218.64,
      "end_seconds": 220.32,
      "duration_seconds": 1.68,
      "text": "Okay, give me a moment..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 230.79,
      "end_seconds": 255.19,
      "duration_seconds": 24.4,
      "text": "Okay: weight 73 kilos, height 150 centimetres. And pulse is 72 beats a minute, BMI works out to 32.4, temperature is 37.0 degrees, SpO2 97 percent on room air, pressure 120 over 70. It's quite normal to feel unsure at this point. People often expect an instant answer, but a good assessment usually has a few stages, and today is mainly about narrowing things down and making a sensible plan together."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 255.85,
      "end_seconds": 257.44,
      "duration_seconds": 1.59,
      "text": "That's reassuring to hear."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 259.19,
      "end_seconds": 261.72,
      "duration_seconds": 2.53,
      "text": "Let me have a look at you now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 262.97,
      "end_seconds": 265.12,
      "duration_seconds": 2.15,
      "text": "Now bend it for me, slowly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 275.78,
      "end_seconds": 278.95,
      "duration_seconds": 3.17,
      "text": "Pulse is normal and there's no tremor right now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 281.03,
      "end_seconds": 286.21,
      "duration_seconds": 5.18,
      "text": "Okay, you can sit back up. I'll try to keep this as efficient as I can."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 286.53,
      "end_seconds": 288.55,
      "duration_seconds": 2.02,
      "text": "Thank you, I appreciate it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 290.12,
      "end_seconds": 306.77,
      "duration_seconds": 16.65,
      "text": "From what you've told me and what I found, it fits best with low sugar episodes related to diabetes medication. The reason I say that is that your story and my examination fit together. It could also be a meal-timing issue, so we'll keep that open."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 308.18,
      "end_seconds": 312.43,
      "duration_seconds": 4.25,
      "text": "I've been thinking the worst, to be honest. Is it bad?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 312.76,
      "end_seconds": 328.16,
      "duration_seconds": 15.4,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's low sugar episodes related to diabetes medication, and we'll know more once the an HbA1c is back. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've had shaky spells, severe, and no confusion or weight loss."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 329.26,
      "end_seconds": 330.49,
      "duration_seconds": 1.23,
      "text": "That's it, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 330.86,
      "end_seconds": 333.09,
      "duration_seconds": 2.23,
      "text": "How's everything else at home otherwise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 334.28,
      "end_seconds": 339.65,
      "duration_seconds": 5.37,
      "text": "Busy. Everyone's running in different directions at the moment, you know how it is."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 340.87,
      "end_seconds": 343.92,
      "duration_seconds": 3.05,
      "text": "I'm going to order an HbA1c, for diabetes control."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 344.7,
      "end_seconds": 347.13,
      "duration_seconds": 2.43,
      "text": "Alright. When can I do that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 348.21,
      "end_seconds": 370.42,
      "duration_seconds": 22.21,
      "text": "Always keep glucose tablets or a sweet in your bag, and don't skip meals if you've taken your sugar tablet. Avoid taking any extra painkillers on top of what I'm prescribing without checking with us. Try to get to bed and wake up at the same time each day, and keep your phone away from the bed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 371.73,
      "end_seconds": 380.0,
      "duration_seconds": 8.27,
      "text": "I want you to come back or go to emergency straight away if you black out or can't wake up properly after an episode."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 381.03,
      "end_seconds": 381.73,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Understood."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 382.86,
      "end_seconds": 390.7,
      "duration_seconds": 7.84,
      "text": "Come back in two weeks. Before we finish, can you repeat the plan back to me so I know I haven't been confusing?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0057",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 392.09,
      "end_seconds": 396.33,
      "duration_seconds": 4.24,
      "text": "So, I come back in two weeks. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0058",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 397.92,
      "end_seconds": 402.84,
      "duration_seconds": 4.92,
      "text": "Right, yes, exactly right. Okay, I think we're finished. Is everything clear?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0059",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 403.91,
      "end_seconds": 405.48,
      "duration_seconds": 1.57,
      "text": "No questions. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0060",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 406.46,
      "end_seconds": 408.89,
      "duration_seconds": 2.43,
      "text": "Bye for now, look after yourself."
    }
  ]
}